title: "thermal-equity-data-integrity"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived data for a study of how illicit data markets
  distort AI-assisted urban forest planning: a proof-of-concept experiment on
  satellite-derived land surface temperature and gridded population for
  Nanjing, China, and a synthetic replication.
